    "notes": [
      "SPELLING CORRECTED (research 2026-07-03): the period genealogy (Genealogy of the Hibbard Family, 1901, entry #163) consistently spells this wife's surname 'Dugan' — 'Mrs. Anna Dugan of Marblehead, b. 1760, d. 19 Dec 1804' — not 'Dugard.' Per the same source, she (not Mary Lyons) was very likely the mother of Joseph Hibbard III (I182541965880/I182541959308) and his siblings, since all are dated after this 9 Jul 1780 marriage."
